@startuml UC01_Login
title UC-01/UC-02 - 회원가입 및 로그인

actor "User" as User
boundary "Login/Register Screen" as UI
control "AuthController" as AuthController
control "AuthService" as AuthService
control "PasswordEncoder" as PasswordEncoder
entity "UserRepository" as UserRepository
database "Database" as DB
entity "AuthSession" as AuthSession

User -> UI: 이메일, 비밀번호, 이름 입력
UI -> AuthController: signUp(email, password, name)
AuthController -> AuthService: register(email, password, name)
AuthService -> UserRepository: existsByEmail(email)
UserRepository -> DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
DB --> UserRepository: 사용자 존재 여부
UserRepository --> AuthService: exists

alt 이미 가입된 이메일인 경우
  AuthService --> AuthController: DuplicateEmailException
  AuthController --> UI: 가입 실패 메시지
  UI --> User: 이메일 중복 안내
else 가입 가능한 이메일인 경우
  AuthService -> PasswordEncoder: encode(password)
  PasswordEncoder --> AuthService: passwordHash
  AuthService -> UserRepository: save(User)
  UserRepository -> DB: INSERT user
  DB --> UserRepository: 저장 완료
  UserRepository --> AuthService: savedUser
  AuthService --> AuthController: 회원가입 성공
  AuthController --> UI: 가입 완료 메시지
  UI --> User: 로그인 화면 표시
end

User -> UI: 이메일, 비밀번호 입력
UI -> AuthController: login(email, password)
AuthController -> AuthService: authenticate(email, password)
AuthService -> UserRepository: findByEmail(email)
UserRepository -> DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
DB --> UserRepository: user
UserRepository --> AuthService: user
AuthService -> PasswordEncoder: matches(password, passwordHash)
PasswordEncoder --> AuthService: 검증 결과

alt 인증 실패
  AuthService --> AuthController: AuthenticationException
  AuthController --> UI: 로그인 실패 메시지
  UI --> User: 이메일 또는 비밀번호 확인 안내
else 인증 성공
  AuthService -> AuthSession: create(user)
  AuthSession --> AuthService: accessToken, refreshToken
  AuthService --> AuthController: LoginResponse
  AuthController --> UI: 토큰 및 사용자 정보 반환
  UI --> User: 메인 화면 이동
end

@enduml

@startuml UC03_CreateSchedule
title UC-03 - 학습 일정 등록 및 마감 알림

actor "User" as User
boundary "Calendar Screen" as UI
control "ScheduleController" as ScheduleController
control "ScheduleService" as ScheduleService
control "NotificationService" as NotificationService
control "CalendarSyncService" as CalendarSyncService
entity "ScheduleRepository" as ScheduleRepository
entity "NotificationRepository" as NotificationRepository
entity "ExternalCalendarLink" as ExternalCalendarLink
database "Database" as DB
collections "External Calendar API" as ExternalCalendarAPI

User -> UI: 일정명, 날짜, 시간, 과목, 중요도 입력
UI -> ScheduleController: createSchedule(request)
ScheduleController -> ScheduleService: createSchedule(userId, request)
ScheduleService -> ScheduleRepository: save(StudySchedule)
ScheduleRepository -> DB: INSERT study_schedule
DB --> ScheduleRepository: 저장 완료
ScheduleRepository --> ScheduleService: savedSchedule

ScheduleService -> NotificationService: createDeadlineNotification(savedSchedule)
NotificationService -> NotificationRepository: save(Notification)
NotificationRepository -> DB: INSERT notification
DB --> NotificationRepository: 저장 완료
NotificationRepository --> NotificationService: savedNotification
NotificationService --> ScheduleService: 알림 예약 완료

opt 외부 캘린더 연동이 켜져 있는 경우
  ScheduleService -> CalendarSyncService: sync(savedSchedule)
  CalendarSyncService -> ExternalCalendarLink: getProvider(userId)
  ExternalCalendarLink --> CalendarSyncService: provider, externalAccountId
  CalendarSyncService -> ExternalCalendarAPI: createEvent(savedSchedule)
  ExternalCalendarAPI --> CalendarSyncService: externalEventId
  CalendarSyncService --> ScheduleService: 외부 캘린더 동기화 완료
end

ScheduleService --> ScheduleController: ScheduleResponse
ScheduleController --> UI: 등록된 일정 정보 반환
UI --> User: 캘린더에 일정 표시

@enduml

@startuml UC04_UpdateTaskStatus
title UC-04 - 칸반 태스크 상태 변경

actor "User" as User
boundary "Kanban Board Screen" as UI
control "TaskController" as TaskController
control "TaskService" as TaskService
control "NotificationService" as NotificationService
entity "TaskRepository" as TaskRepository
database "Database" as DB

User -> UI: 태스크 카드를 다른 컬럼으로 이동
UI -> TaskController: updateTaskStatus(taskId, status)
TaskController -> TaskService: updateStatus(userId, taskId, status)
TaskService -> TaskRepository: findByIdAndUserId(taskId, userId)
TaskRepository -> DB: SELECT task WHERE task_id = ? AND user_id = ?
DB --> TaskRepository: task
TaskRepository --> TaskService: StudyTask

alt 태스크가 존재하지 않는 경우
  TaskService --> TaskController: TaskNotFoundException
  TaskController --> UI: 상태 변경 실패
  UI --> User: 태스크를 찾을 수 없음 안내
else 태스크가 존재하는 경우
  TaskService -> TaskService: task.moveTo(status)
  TaskService -> TaskRepository: save(task)
  TaskRepository -> DB: UPDATE study_task
  DB --> TaskRepository: 수정 완료

  opt 완료 상태로 변경한 경우
    TaskService -> NotificationService: cancelDeadlineNotification(taskId)
    NotificationService --> TaskService: 알림 취소 완료
  end

  TaskService --> TaskController: TaskResponse
  TaskController --> UI: 변경된 태스크 정보 반환
  UI --> User: 칸반 보드 갱신
end

@enduml

@startuml UC06_GenerateWrongAnswerNote
title UC-06 - AI 오답노트 생성

actor "User" as User
boundary "Wrong Answer Screen" as UI
control "AIController" as AIController
control "AIService" as AIService
control "WrongAnswerService" as WrongAnswerService
entity "WrongAnswerRepository" as WrongAnswerRepository
entity "AIRecommendationRepository" as RecommendationRepository
database "Database" as DB
collections "External AI API" as ExternalAI

User -> UI: 문제 내용, 사용자 답안, 과목 입력
UI -> AIController: generateWrongAnswerNote(request)
AIController -> AIService: analyzeWrongAnswer(userId, request)
AIService -> ExternalAI: generateExplanation(problem, userAnswer, subject)
ExternalAI --> AIService: 정답, 해설, 취약 유형

alt AI 응답 생성 실패
  AIService --> AIController: AIResponseException
  AIController --> UI: 오답노트 생성 실패
  UI --> User: 잠시 후 다시 시도 안내
else AI 응답 생성 성공
  AIService -> WrongAnswerService: createWrongAnswerNote(analysisResult)
  WrongAnswerService -> WrongAnswerRepository: save(WrongAnswerNote)
  WrongAnswerRepository -> DB: INSERT wrong_answer_note
  DB --> WrongAnswerRepository: 저장 완료
  WrongAnswerRepository --> WrongAnswerService: savedWrongAnswerNote

  AIService -> RecommendationRepository: save(AIRecommendation)
  RecommendationRepository -> DB: INSERT ai_recommendation
  DB --> RecommendationRepository: 저장 완료

  AIService --> AIController: WrongAnswerNoteResponse
  AIController --> UI: 생성된 오답노트 반환
  UI --> User: 오답노트와 취약 유형 표시
end

@enduml

@startuml UC07_GenerateQuiz
title UC-07 - AI 기반 퀴즈 생성

actor "User" as User
boundary "Study Note Screen" as UI
control "QuizController" as QuizController
control "QuizService" as QuizService
control "AIService" as AIService
entity "StudyNoteRepository" as NoteRepository
entity "QuizRepository" as QuizRepository
database "Database" as DB
collections "External AI API" as ExternalAI

User -> UI: 노트 선택, 문제 수, 난이도 입력
UI -> QuizController: generateQuiz(noteId, difficulty, count)
QuizController -> QuizService: generateQuiz(userId, noteId, difficulty, count)
QuizService -> NoteRepository: findByIdAndUserId(noteId, userId)
NoteRepository -> DB: SELECT study_note WHERE note_id = ? AND user_id = ?
DB --> NoteRepository: studyNote
NoteRepository --> QuizService: StudyNote

alt 학습 노트가 존재하지 않는 경우
  QuizService --> QuizController: NoteNotFoundException
  QuizController --> UI: 퀴즈 생성 실패
  UI --> User: 노트를 찾을 수 없음 안내
else 학습 노트가 존재하는 경우
  QuizService -> AIService: generateQuiz(studyNote, difficulty, count)
  AIService -> ExternalAI: createQuiz(noteContent, difficulty, count)
  ExternalAI --> AIService: 문제, 보기, 정답, 해설
  AIService --> QuizService: Quiz
  QuizService -> QuizRepository: save(Quiz)
  QuizRepository -> DB: INSERT quiz, quiz_question
  DB --> QuizRepository: 저장 완료
  QuizRepository --> QuizService: savedQuiz
  QuizService --> QuizController: QuizResponse
  QuizController --> UI: 생성된 퀴즈 반환
  UI --> User: 퀴즈 화면 표시
end

@enduml

@startuml UC11_ViewStudyStatistics
title UC-11 - 학습 통계 및 히트맵 조회

actor "User" as User
boundary "Statistics Screen" as UI
control "StatisticsController" as StatisticsController
control "StatisticsService" as StatisticsService
entity "FocusSessionRepository" as FocusSessionRepository
entity "TaskRepository" as TaskRepository
database "Database" as DB

User -> UI: 통계 기간 선택
UI -> StatisticsController: getStatistics(periodStart, periodEnd)
StatisticsController -> StatisticsService: getStatistics(userId, periodStart, periodEnd)

StatisticsService -> FocusSessionRepository: findByUserAndPeriod(userId, periodStart, periodEnd)
FocusSessionRepository -> DB: SELECT focus_session WHERE user_id = ? AND period BETWEEN ? AND ?
DB --> FocusSessionRepository: focusSessions
FocusSessionRepository --> StatisticsService: focusSessions

StatisticsService -> TaskRepository: findByUserAndPeriod(userId, periodStart, periodEnd)
TaskRepository -> DB: SELECT study_task WHERE user_id = ? AND updated_at BETWEEN ? AND ?
DB --> TaskRepository: tasks
TaskRepository --> StatisticsService: tasks

StatisticsService -> StatisticsService: calculateTotalStudyMinutes(focusSessions)
StatisticsService -> StatisticsService: calculateCompletionRate(tasks)
StatisticsService -> StatisticsService: createHeatmap(focusSessions)
StatisticsService --> StatisticsController: StatisticsResponse
StatisticsController --> UI: 총 공부 시간, 완료율, 히트맵 데이터
UI --> User: 그래프와 히트맵 표시

@enduml

@startuml UC10_BoardAndAdmin
title UC-10/UC-18 - 게시판 작성 및 관리자 신고 처리

actor "User" as User
actor "Admin" as Admin
boundary "Board Screen" as BoardUI
boundary "Admin Screen" as AdminUI
control "BoardController" as BoardController
control "AdminController" as AdminController
control "BoardService" as BoardService
control "AdminService" as AdminService
entity "PostRepository" as PostRepository
entity "CommentRepository" as CommentRepository
database "Database" as DB

User -> BoardUI: 게시판 카테고리, 제목, 내용 입력
BoardUI -> BoardController: createPost(request)
BoardController -> BoardService: createPost(userId, request)
BoardService -> PostRepository: save(BoardPost)
PostRepository -> DB: INSERT board_post
DB --> PostRepository: 저장 완료
PostRepository --> BoardService: savedPost
BoardService --> BoardController: PostResponse
BoardController --> BoardUI: 게시글 정보 반환
BoardUI --> User: 게시글 표시

User -> BoardUI: 부적절한 게시글 신고
BoardUI -> BoardController: reportPost(postId, reason)
BoardController -> BoardService: reportPost(userId, postId, reason)
BoardService -> PostRepository: markAsReported(postId, reason)
PostRepository -> DB: UPDATE board_post SET reported = true
DB --> PostRepository: 신고 상태 저장
BoardService --> BoardController: 신고 접수 완료
BoardController --> BoardUI: 신고 접수 메시지
BoardUI --> User: 신고 완료 안내

Admin -> AdminUI: 신고 게시글 목록 조회
AdminUI -> AdminController: getReportedPosts()
AdminController -> AdminService: getReportedPosts(adminId)
AdminService -> PostRepository: findReportedPosts()
PostRepository -> DB: SELECT board_post WHERE reported = true
DB --> PostRepository: reportedPosts
PostRepository --> AdminService: reportedPosts
AdminService --> AdminController: ReportedPostList
AdminController --> AdminUI: 신고 게시글 목록 반환
AdminUI --> Admin: 신고 게시글 목록 표시

Admin -> AdminUI: 게시글 숨김 또는 삭제 처리
AdminUI -> AdminController: moderatePost(postId, action)
AdminController -> AdminService: moderatePost(adminId, postId, action)

alt 게시글 숨김
  AdminService -> PostRepository: hide(postId)
  PostRepository -> DB: UPDATE board_post SET hidden = true
  DB --> PostRepository: 처리 완료
else 게시글 삭제
  AdminService -> CommentRepository: deleteByPostId(postId)
  CommentRepository -> DB: DELETE comment WHERE post_id = ?
  DB --> CommentRepository: 댓글 삭제 완료
  AdminService -> PostRepository: delete(postId)
  PostRepository -> DB: DELETE board_post WHERE post_id = ?
  DB --> PostRepository: 게시글 삭제 완료
end

AdminService --> AdminController: ModerationResult
AdminController --> AdminUI: 처리 결과 반환
AdminUI --> Admin: 운영 처리 완료 표시

@enduml
